   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prefill processes all 20,000 tokens in parallel: compute bound.\nDecode makes one token per step and re-reads the weights plus the whole KV cache from HBM each time: memory-bandwidth bound.\nThat's why HBM size and bandwidth (H200 4.8 TB/s, Trainium2 ~2.9 TB/s) decide how many users one chip can serve.",
   "originalText": "Prefill processes all 20,000 tokens in parallel: compute bound.\nDecode makes one token per step and re-reads the weights plus the whole KV cache from HBM each time: memory-bandwidth bound.\nThat's why HBM size and bandwidth (H200 4.8 TB/s, Trainium2 ~2.9 TB/s) decide how many users one chip can serve.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
